A game that #link("https://github.com/YouSafe")[Yousif] and I made for the Computergraphics UE course at the TU Vienna. #link("https://github.com/stefnotch/cgue23-cat-to-the-past")[Click here to grab a copy of the game].

We made it with Rust and Vulkan and a lot of human effort. Excellent experience, but would use a game engine if I had to do it again. Or at least WebGPU instead of Vulkan.

